{
  "schema": "csaf-uikit-theme/1",
  "id": "silverpoint",
  "name": "Silverpoint",
  "note": "Kit 9 (2026-10-23): a flat, light, minimal FANTASY theme, the sibling of Clean Slate. Warm vellum fills, sepia ink hairlines, square-ish 2-unit corners, a soft straight-down shadow. Its frame idea is geometry.keyline \"notch\": a second, softer hairline inside the outline of the heavy frames, turned inward at each corner as a square bookplate notch with a muted gold pin. One muted gold accent family (dark ink text), one oxblood danger family, opt-in equipment slots with faint silhouettes. Every text-on-fill pair is re-measured by the gate.",
